# Note: api/index.js (the esbuild bundle of server/app.ts) is intentionally
# committed, not gitignored — Vercel detects Serverless Functions from the
# repo tree before running the Build Command, so a build-time-generated
# file under /api is never picked up. Regenerate it with `npm run build:api`
# whenever server/app.ts or its dependencies change, and commit the result.